 "about": "A collage poster built in one take: torn and scissor-cut pieces (\"cutout\", with a paper rim and a printed shadow) of engine-made imagery. There is a posterised gradient-map ocean shader, a duotone and halftoned gem, an ink-textured red sun in multiply and the title on a cut strip of yellow paper. Hard camera reframes on the beat stand in for cuts inside one composition. The image source is yours to choose (any shader, image, video or composition takes the same treatment and cutout). The full piece uses Anton. It is slow (two shaders per frame); for drafts, swap the shaders for images.",
